CHAPTER.VERS:
Thou shalt bring down the noise of strangers, as the
Meaning, that as the heat is abated by the rain, so shall God bring down the rage of the wicked. heat in a dry place;
As a cloud shades from the heat of the sun, so God will assuage the rejoicing of the wicked against the godly. [even] the heat with the shadow of a cloud: the branch of the terrible ones shall be brought low.
